{"title":"2024 IOQM/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_IOQM/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The age of a person (in years) in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/d/78db23e86da8fe319c63bdb5eaf6d3fd8fefa17b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2025$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> is a perfect square. His age (in years) was also a perfect square in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/8/f48f95ec89b6c50220ecbbbb6130586135db8ff6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2012$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" />.\nHis age (in years) will be a perfect cube <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> years after <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/d/78db23e86da8fe319c63bdb5eaf6d3fd8fefa17b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2025$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />. Determine the smallest value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_IOQM/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If this person's age in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/8/f48f95ec89b6c50220ecbbbb6130586135db8ff6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2012$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/d/78db23e86da8fe319c63bdb5eaf6d3fd8fefa17b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2025$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> are perfect squares, then the ages must be prefect squares that differ by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/030e19e4e2f1c074127cb50581e8496470c5419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Let the ages in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/8/f48f95ec89b6c50220ecbbbb6130586135db8ff6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2012$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/d/78db23e86da8fe319c63bdb5eaf6d3fd8fefa17b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2025$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/9/9698c992334be77221be8c8c819909eca34fde9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/d/a1d03c3c5b9abf1bdb0c9df06fe5fb11ae13d0e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" />, respectively, for positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> (note that then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/f/9dfc685c058a3923bc44dc7a591ea65066c69dea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&gt;a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />). Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/8/7e88de82809d3ff976247a33c2badeb06fa5f9ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2-a^2=13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/a/a5a2362a8f086dae29be5710de2bd0a83b1a1b43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(b-a)(b+a)=13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"152\" height=\"20\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are positive integers with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/f/9dfc685c058a3923bc44dc7a591ea65066c69dea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&gt;a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/c/02c60c151331e235dc6d9df7ca403b6f0c9af39b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b-a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/b/62bdadf8cf9891bb42812ef0d8ebdfa6cc7feb9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"39\" height=\"14\" /> must then both be positive integers. Since the only way to factor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/030e19e4e2f1c074127cb50581e8496470c5419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> into the product into two positive integers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/d/32d0f49335a06ad29e6d6b2dc88772366d06265e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\times13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/e/53ec928e0159f2ddbcd47c03822788e22e454a01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b-a&lt;b+a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" /> since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/f/9dfc685c058a3923bc44dc7a591ea65066c69dea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&gt;a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> are both positive integers, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/6/276f19d13344062039a7ec1907adb2f96d92dea2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b-a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"72\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/a/fea77f1939fa84d1a9795fdf77a12cb00474bc4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+a=13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />, and solving this system gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/5/fa5507ab5a3d1f06941dabd1c26505d646367983.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/e/3fe4d6ebef2a09e428f2984fb2d677c342dbe1bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=7$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />. Therefore, the person's age in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/8/f48f95ec89b6c50220ecbbbb6130586135db8ff6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2012$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/4/70423c387bce7f27ae553801328783d95025d3b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2=6^2=36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"102\" height=\"17\" /> and this person's age in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/d/78db23e86da8fe319c63bdb5eaf6d3fd8fefa17b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2025$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/b/49b3d28018e0ac27eff53885d78e7d2b2a249188.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2=7^2=49$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"100\" height=\"17\" />. The number of years after <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/d/78db23e86da8fe319c63bdb5eaf6d3fd8fefa17b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2025$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> for his age to be a perfect cube is the absolute difference between his age in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/d/78db23e86da8fe319c63bdb5eaf6d3fd8fefa17b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2025$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />. The first age greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/c/34c8e6bf4d57cd6f2bb0d7d43e00f0f442f53b84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> that is a perfect cube is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/f/5ffe154581123ce180c6e89b94bc3302d318ef86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^3=64$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"59\" height=\"15\" />, so the absolute difference is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/4/bb4ecb43927851b098f5e7d77a6349db9f73d65a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lvert64-49\\rvert=15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"113\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/3/f73a8dcb8bba5c7529a6cded96fa1226d78e7dae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"30\" height=\"23\" /> is the least possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>~Yuhao2012\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018065859\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.014 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.023 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 144/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7456/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36158:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018065859 and revision id 280716. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}